<%- include('partials/header') %>

<!-- Top Hero Banner (Compact & Animated with 2 AM Study - Matches Music, Blog, & About) -->
<section class="hero-terms-section">
  <div class="container text-center">
    <div class="hero-terms-badge">
      <span class="pulse-dot"></span>
      <span>Legal &amp; Transparency</span>
      <i class="fa-solid fa-scale-balanced text-primary ms-1" style="font-size: 0.85rem;"></i>
    </div>
    
    <h1 class="animated-2am-title">
      Terms &amp; Conditions — <span class="gradient-2am-text">2 AM Study</span>
    </h1>
    
    <p class="hero-terms-subtitle">
      Please review our community guidelines, intellectual property terms, and platform usage policies.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
/* Hero Section & Animations (Matches Music & Blog Page Hero) */
@keyframes gradientShift {
  0% { background-position: 0% 50%; }
  50% { background-position: 100% 50%; }
  100% { background-position: 0% 50%; }
}

@keyframes pulseGlow {
  0%, 100% { transform: scale(1); opacity: 0.8; }
  50% { transform: scale(1.2); opacity: 1; box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.7); }
}

.hero-terms-section {
  padding: 85px 16px 24px !important;
  background: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 0%, rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.08) 0%, transparent 65%), #f8fafc;
  border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.06);
}

.hero-terms-badge {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 8px;
  background: #ffffff;
  border: 1px solid rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.2);
  box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.08);
  border-radius: 50px;
  padding: 5px 14px;
  font-size: 0.82rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  color: #1e40af;
  margin-bottom: 10px;
}

.pulse-dot {
  width: 8px;
  height: 8px;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: #2563eb;
  animation: pulseGlow 1.8s infinite ease-in-out;
}

.animated-2am-title {
  font-size: 2.2rem;
  font-weight: 800;
  letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  color: #0f172a;
  margin-bottom: 6px;
}

.gradient-2am-text {
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #2563eb 0%, #7c3aed 45%, #ec4899 75%, #2563eb 100%);
  background-size: 300% 300%;
  -webkit-background-clip: text;
  background-clip: text;
  -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
  animation: gradientShift 5s ease infinite;
}

.hero-terms-subtitle {
  font-size: 0.92rem;
  color: #64748b;
  max-width: 640px;
  margin: 0 auto;
  line-height: 1.5;
}

@media (max-width: 768px) {
  .animated-2am-title {
    font-size: 1.65rem;
  }
}

.terms-card {
  background: #ffffff;
  border: 1px solid rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.08);
  border-radius: 20px;
  padding: 2.5rem;
  box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.04);
}

.terms-section-title {
  font-size: 1.25rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  color: #0f172a;
  margin-top: 2rem;
  margin-bottom: 0.8rem;
  padding-bottom: 0.4rem;
  border-bottom: 2px solid #f1f5f9;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 0.5rem;
}
</style>

<main class="container py-5 my-0">
  <div class="terms-card">
    <div class="d-flex flex-wrap justify-content-between align-items-center mb-4 pb-3 border-bottom">
      <div>
        <span class="badge bg-primary bg-opacity-10 text-primary px-3 py-1.5 rounded-pill fw-semibold mb-1">Official Policy</span>
        <h2 class="fw-bold text-dark mb-0">Platform Agreement &amp; Rules</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="text-muted small mt-2 mt-md-0">
        <i class="fa-regular fa-clock me-1 text-primary"></i> Last updated: <span id="current-date" class="fw-semibold text-dark"></span>
      </div>
    </div>
    
    <div class="terms-content lh-lg text-secondary" style="font-size: 0.96rem;">
      <p class="lead text-dark fw-normal mb-4">
        Welcome to <strong>2 AM Study</strong>! These terms and conditions outline the rules, rights, and responsibilities governing your use of our educational ecosystem, productivity tools, and online store.
      </p>
      
      <div class="p-3 bg-light rounded-3 mb-4 border-start border-4 border-primary">
        <p class="mb-0 text-dark small">
          By accessing and using <strong>2 AM Study</strong>, you accept these terms and conditions in full. If you do not agree with any part of these terms, please discontinue use of the platform immediately.
        </p>
      </div>

      <h3 class="terms-section-title"><i class="fa-solid fa-book-bookmark text-primary"></i> 1. Terminology</h3>
      <p>The following terminology applies to these Terms and Conditions, Privacy Statement, and all Platform Agreements: "Client", "You", and "Your" refers to you, the individual accessing this website. "The Company", "Ourselves", "We", "Our", and "Us", refers to <strong>2 AM Study</strong>. "Party" or "Parties" refers to both the user and ourselves.</p>

      <h3 class="terms-section-title"><i class="fa-solid fa-cookie-bite text-warning"></i> 2. Cookies &amp; Data Cache</h3>
      <p>We employ cookies and browser storage (such as LocalStorage) to keep track of your focus streaks, timer preferences, and study room settings. By continuing to use 2 AM Study, you consent to our use of essential cookies in accordance with our Privacy Policy.</p>

      <h3 class="terms-section-title"><i class="fa-solid fa-certificate text-success"></i> 3. Intellectual Property Rights &amp; License</h3>
      <p>Unless otherwise stated, <strong>2 AM Study</strong> and/or its licensors own the intellectual property rights for all material, code, and branding on 2 AM Study. All intellectual property rights are reserved. You are granted a personal, non-commercial license for your personal study and learning.</p>
      
      <p class="fw-semibold text-dark mb-2">You must not:</p>
      <ul class="mb-4 ps-4">
        <li>Republish, scrape, or distribute proprietary study materials from 2 AM Study without attribution.</li>
        <li>Sell, rent, or sub-license material or software tools from 2 AM Study.</li>
        <li>Reproduce, duplicate, or mirror platform features for commercial gain.</li>
      </ul>

      <h3 class="terms-section-title"><i class="fa-solid fa-comments text-info"></i> 4. Student Community &amp; Content</h3>
      <p>Certain areas of the website allow students to post feedback, review notes, and participate in peer rooms. 2 AM Study does not endorse user-generated comments and reserves the right to remove any content deemed offensive, spam, or in breach of these Terms.</p>

      <h3 class="terms-section-title"><i class="fa-solid fa-link text-primary"></i> 5. Hyperlinking &amp; Platform Access</h3>
      <p>Educational institutions, student organizations, research bodies, and search engines may freely link to our home page or study tools provided the link is not misleading and does not falsely imply endorsement.</p>

      <h3 class="terms-section-title"><i class="fa-solid fa-shield-halved text-danger"></i> 6. Disclaimer &amp; Limitation of Liability</h3>
      <p>All study tools, timers, calculators, and materials on 2 AM Study are provided on an "as-is" basis for educational assistance. To the fullest extent permitted by law, 2 AM Study excludes liability for any incidental downtime, study interruptions, or external third-party content.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</main>

<script>
  document.getElementById('current-date').textContent = new Date().toLocaleDateString('en-US', { year: 'numeric', month: 'long', day: 'numeric' });
</script>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>
